    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Sanctum of the Forgotten Archmage. You are a wizard apprentice who has stumbled into this hidden chamber deep beneath the wizarding academy. The air hums with latent arcane energy, and ancient runes glow faintly on the damp stone walls. The Archmage was known to have sealed his most powerful spell within this very room, guarded by an intricate network of magical artifacts, enchanted chests, and mystical instruments. Your objective is to awaken the Final Alter and claim the ultimate spell. However, the magical devices here are deeply intertwined. Some artifacts require the resonant energies of others to function, creating a complex web of spells and incantations. You must explore the chamber, understand the relationships between the tools left behind, and channel their powers correctly. Time is of the essence, as the protective wards of the Sanctum are slowly closing in. Solve the mysteries of these ancient relics and prove yourself worthy of the Archmage's legacy.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
